message: "Metadata for the local SportSpace research software. This is not a citation of a published paper; public release metadata must be finalized before archiving."
type: software
title: "SportSpace: urban activity access explorer"
authors:
  - family-names: "Poturak"
    given-names: "Semir"
    affiliation: "University of Travnik, Faculty of Technical Sciences"
  - family-names: "Tuzović"
