version: "0.24-local"
abstract: "A 2D/3D research prototype for exploring activity destinations, modeled network access and destination-exclusion sensitivity scenarios in Stup / Ilidza. Synthetic origins are not residents. The prototype does not estimate health effects."
keywords:
  - urban activity spaces
  - network accessibility
  - geovisualization
  - scenario analysis
